+ in compounds of adjective followed by noun), the hyphen is required to separate p & h. See ^^HYPHENS^^.

**topmost.** See ^^-MOST^^.

**torchon.** See ^^FRENCH WORDS^^.

**tormentress.** See ^^FEMININE DESIGNATIONS^^.

**tornado, torpedo.** Pl.
>>>

