<<<
-OR^^. torso. Pl. -os; see -o(£)s 6. tortoise. Pronounce tor’tus; the pronunciation -oiz or -ois is not even given as an alternative by the OED. torus. Pl. -77. toss. For tossed & tost see -T & -ED. total.
